# ("운영 전환"): SITE_URL / AUTH_URL = https://visanjob.co.kr, rebuild, then remove the staging
# block above (or keep it with its own basic auth). No basic auth, no X-Robots-Tag here: the app
# sends noindex itself for private areas (src/middleware.ts) and serves its own robots.txt.
